{"title": "Common and Proper Nouns Quiz", "sentences": [{"n": 1, "text": "Will Hobbs has written many great books for young readers.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["books"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["readers"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["will", "hobbs"]}]}, {"n": 2, "text": "What excitement the children in the stories experience!", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["excitement"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["children"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["stories"]}]}, {"n": 3, "text": "In Ghost Canoe, Nathan MacAllister investigates a shipwreck.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["shipwreck"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["ghost", "canoe"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["nathan", "macallister"]}]}, {"n": 4, "text": "Nathan and his mother live with the Makah Indians near the Pacific Ocean.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["mother"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["nathan"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["makah", "indians"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["pacific", "ocean"]}]}, {"n": 5, "text": "After a ship crashes on the rocks near the shore, strange events occur.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["ship"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["rocks"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["shore"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["events"]}]}, {"n": 6, "text": "Who is the wild, hairy man that is hiding in the caves?", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["man"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["caves"]}]}, {"n": 7, "text": "Captain Bim, a neighbor, buries treasures during the night.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["neighbor"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["treasures"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["night"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["captain", "bim"]}]}, {"n": 8, "text": "A skeleton in an old canoe is discovered in a strange place: high in a tree.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["skeleton"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["canoe"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["place"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["tree"]}]}, {"n": 9, "text": "Nathan and Lighthouse George search for clues to these mysteries.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["clues"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["mysteries"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["nathan"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["lighthouse", "george"]}]}, {"n": 10, "text": "Nathan shows great bravery and self-reliance during his adventure.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["bravery"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["self-reliance"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["adventure"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["nathan"]}]}, {"n": 11, "text": "Alan frequently reads books about action and adventure.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["books"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["action"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["adventure"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["alan"]}]}, {"n": 12, "text": "Alan and his friends recently discovered the author Will Hobbs.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["friends"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["author"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["alan"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["will", "hobbs"]}]}, {"n": 13, "text": "Gloria Byrd and Marcus Katz spent the day at Rosemont Mall.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["day"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["gloria", "byrd"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["marcus", "katz"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["rosemont", "mall"]}]}, {"n": 14, "text": "The two friends visited shops and looked at displays in the windows.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["friends"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["shops"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["displays"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["windows"]}]}, {"n": 15, "text": "Gloria and Christina Santos had first planned the trip to the mall.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["trip"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["mall"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["gloria"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["christina", "santos"]}]}, {"n": 16, "text": "At the last minute, Christina couldn't go.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["minute"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["christina"]}]}, {"n": 17, "text": "Gloria called Marcus, who lives nearby on Shepherd Lane.", "nouns": [{"t": "P", "w": ["gloria"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["marcus"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["shepherd", "lane"]}]}, {"n": 18, "text": "Mrs. Byrd took both friends to the mall.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["friends"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["mall"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["mrs", "byrd"]}]}, {"n": 19, "text": "First, Gloria wanted to look at sneakers at Foot Market.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["sneakers"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["gloria"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["foot", "market"]}]}, {"n": 20, "text": "Next, she and Marcus browsed through the books, maps, and magazines at Skyline Bookstore.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["books"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["maps"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["magazines"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["marcus"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["skyline", "bookstore"]}]}, {"n": 21, "text": "Gloria found a fantastic book on the solar system.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["book"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["solar", "system"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["gloria"]}]}, {"n": 22, "text": "Later, the two teenagers met Mrs. Byrd at the food court.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["teenagers"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["food", "court"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["mrs", "byrd"]}]}, {"n": 23, "text": "The book gave the girl self-confidence for her speech on the planets the next week.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["book"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["girl"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["self-confidence"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["speech"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["planets"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["week"]}]}, {"n": 24, "text": "The book was definitely cited in her report for Ms. Saunders.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["book"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["report"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["ms", "saunders"]}]}, {"n": 25, "text": "My cousin Maria visited the Grand Canyon last summer.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["cousin"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["summer"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["maria"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["grand", "canyon"]}]}, {"n": 26, "text": "The dog chased a squirrel across the yard.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["dog"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["squirrel"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["yard"]}]}, {"n": 27, "text": "Our teacher, Mr. Lopez, gave the class a quiz.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["teacher"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["class"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["quiz"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["mr", "lopez"]}]}, {"n": 28, "text": "The Amazon River is the widest river in the world.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["river"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["world"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["amazon", "river"]}]}, {"n": 29, "text": "Every Friday, the students eat pizza in the cafeteria.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["students"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["pizza"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["cafeteria"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["friday"]}]}, {"n": 30, "text": "A brave firefighter rescued the kitten from the tree.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["firefighter"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["kitten"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["tree"]}]}, {"n": 31, "text": "We ate turkey on Thanksgiving with my grandmother.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["turkey"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["grandmother"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["thanksgiving"]}]}, {"n": 32, "text": "The Eiffel Tower stands in the middle of Paris.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["middle"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["eiffel", "tower"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["paris"]}]}, {"n": 33, "text": "My brother lost his baseball glove at the park.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["brother"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["baseball", "glove"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["park"]}]}, {"n": 34, "text": "Dr. Patel listened to the heartbeat of the patient with a stethoscope.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["heartbeat"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["patient"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["stethoscope"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["dr", "patel"]}]}, {"n": 35, "text": "The astronauts on Apollo 11 planted a flag.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["astronauts"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["flag"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["apollo", "11"]}]}, {"n": 36, "text": "A gentle breeze blew through the open window.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["breeze"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["window"]}]}, {"n": 37, "text": "Jamal scored the winning goal for the Riverside Tigers.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["goal"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["jamal"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["riverside", "tigers"]}]}, {"n": 38, "text": "The library on Oak Street closes early on Sundays.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["library"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["oak", "street"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["sundays"]}]}, {"n": 39, "text": "Honesty is the best policy.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["honesty"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["policy"]}]}, {"n": 40, "text": "The Statue of Liberty was a gift from France.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["gift"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["statue", "of", "liberty"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["france"]}]}, {"n": 41, "text": "My sister-in-law bakes cookies every weekend.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["sister-in-law"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["cookies"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["weekend"]}]}, {"n": 42, "text": "The children built a snowman after the storm.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["children"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["snowman"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["storm"]}]}, {"n": 43, "text": "Mount Everest is the tallest mountain on Earth.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["mountain"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["mount", "everest"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["earth"]}]}, {"n": 44, "text": "The bus driver waved to the kids at the corner.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["bus", "driver"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["kids"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["corner"]}]}, {"n": 45, "text": "Emily and Noah planted tomatoes in the garden.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["tomatoes"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["garden"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["emily"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["noah"]}]}, {"n": 46, "text": "The Titanic sank in the Atlantic Ocean on a cold night.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["night"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["titanic"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["atlantic", "ocean"]}]}, {"n": 47, "text": "A loud thunderstorm woke the whole neighborhood.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["thunderstorm"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["neighborhood"]}]}, {"n": 48, "text": "Coach Rivera taught the team a new play.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["team"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["play"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["coach", "rivera"]}]}, {"n": 49, "text": "The museum has a painting by Frida Kahlo.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["museum"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["painting"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["frida", "kahlo"]}]}, {"n": 50, "text": "Freedom and courage are important ideas.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["freedom"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["courage"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["ideas"]}]}, {"n": 51, "text": "The train to Chicago leaves at noon.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["train"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["noon"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["chicago"]}]}, {"n": 52, "text": "Our neighbor adopted a puppy from the shelter.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["neighbor"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["puppy"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["shelter"]}]}, {"n": 53, "text": "The N