]}]}, {"n": 65, "text": "Grandpa Joe tells stories about his childhood in Texas.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["stories"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["childhood"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["grandpa", "joe"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["texas"]}]}, {"n": 66, "text": "The scientists studied the volcano for many years.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["scientists"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["volcano"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["years"]}]}, {"n": 67, "text": "We watched fireworks on the Fourth of July.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["fireworks"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["fourth", "of", "july"]}]}, {"n": 68, "text": "The mail carrier left a package on the porch.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["mail", "carrier"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["package"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["porch"]}]}, {"n": 69, "text": "Lucas plays the trumpet in the band.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["trumpet"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["band"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["lucas"]}]}, {"n": 70, "text": "The Pacific Ocean is larger than the Atlantic Ocean.", "nouns": [{"t": "P", "w": ["pacific", "ocean"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["atlantic", "ocean"]}]}, {"n": 71, "text": "A friendly waiter brought menus to our table.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["waiter"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["menus"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["table"]}]}, {"n": 72, "text": "Dr. Martin Luther King Jr. dreamed of equality for all people.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["equality"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["people"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["dr", "martin", "luther", "king", "jr"]}]}, {"n": 73, "text": "The hikers found a waterfall behind the boulders.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["hikers"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["waterfall"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["boulders"]}]}, {"n": 74, "text": "Aunt Rosa lives in an apartment in Miami.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["apartment"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["aunt", "rosa"]}, {"t": "P", "w": ["miami"]}]}, {"n": 75, "text": "The mechanic fixed the engine in an hour.", "nouns": [{"t": "C", "w": ["mechanic"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["engine"]}, {"t": "C", "w": ["hour"]}]}, {"n": 76, "text": "Hanukkah lasts for eight nights.", "nouns": [{"t": 